NAME='Pluto'
COVER_SUB='The deep transformation of a generation, sign by sign.'
T=[
("1820s–50s","Pluto in Aries is the force of rebirth through will. This long-gone generation lived through wars of independence and revolutions, and shaped nations by courage and conflict. The shadow is violence for its own sake. The lesson: power begins with the self."),
("1850s–1884","Pluto in Taurus transforms land, money and resources. This generation lived through industrialisation, the railways and the new financial systems, and the way people earn and own changed for good. The shadow is greed. The lesson: what we value reveals who we are."),
("1884–1914","Pluto in Gemini transforms communication and ideas. Science, mass media, the telephone and new theories of the mind arrived, and old certainties dissolved. The shadow is propaganda and information as power. The lesson: words can heal or destroy."),
("1914–37","Pluto in Cancer transforms home, nation and belonging. This generation lived through two crises of the world order, mass migration and the rise of nationalism. The shadow is clinging to the tribe. The lesson: protection should not become exclusion."),
("1937–57","Pluto in Leo transforms power, leadership and the self. This generation lived through dictatorship, war and the rebuilding of the world, and the question of who holds authority. The shadow is the cult of the leader. The lesson: true power serves."),
("1957–71","Pluto in Virgo transforms work, health and service. This generation questioned systems of labour, medicine and daily routine, and brought attention to the environment and to the body. The shadow is control through detail. The lesson: reform begins with the small."),
("1971–84","Pluto in Libra transforms relationships, law and justice. This generation changed marriage, partnership and equality, and exposed the power hidden in contracts and in diplomacy. The shadow is manipulation. The lesson: a balance of power is a daily negotiation."),
("1984–95","Pluto in Scorpio is at home: death, sexuality, secrets and shared resources. This generation met the era of crisis, hidden finances and psychology, and intense experiences of loss and rebirth. The shadow is obsession and abuse of power. The lesson: transformation asks for surrender."),
("1995–2008","Pluto in Sagittarius transforms belief, religion and the global view. This generation grew up with the clash of ideologies and the expansion of the world through travel and media. The shadow is fanaticism. The lesson: truth should not need enemies."),
("2008–24","Pluto in Capricorn transforms institutions, finance and authority. This generation lived through financial crisis and the questioning of governments and corporations, as old structures decayed. The shadow is control and collapse. The lesson: durable power must be fair."),
("2024–43","Pluto in Aquarius transforms technology, society and the idea of the collective. This generation lives through artificial intelligence, new networks and a new debate about freedom and control. The shadow is surveillance and the loss of individuality. The lesson: the future must stay human."),
("2043–68","Pluto in Pisces will transform spirituality, imagination and the boundary between worlds. It is a future generation whose task is to dissolve old illusions and to rediscover compassion at a deep level. The shadow will be collective escape. The lesson: faith should heal."),
]
